stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Read: trigger (watcher / timer / CLI / attach)
    Read --> Gate: for each subscribed copy<br/>read heads, commits, trees<br/>L = hash(local), B = last synced
    Gate --> Stopped: tombstone, store lost, local deleted,<br/>deck gone, version mismatch, held
    Gate --> InFlight: commit or tree missing,<br/>or provider not current
    Gate --> Forked: heads not ancestry-ordered
    Gate --> Compare: R = the tip all heads descend from
    Compare --> InSync: L == R
    Compare --> Behind: L == B, R != B
    Compare --> Ahead: L != B, R == B
    Compare --> Diverged: L != B, R != B
    Diverged --> Forked: push local edit as its own commit
    Behind --> Apply: two-phase apply (ADR 0008)
    Ahead --> Push: tree, commit (parent B),<br/>head written last
    Apply --> Blocked: verify failed, rolled back
    Apply --> InSync: verified, B and head := R
    Push --> InSync: B and head := new commit
    Forked --> Notify: deduplicated alert,<br/>no app files touched
    Blocked --> Notify
    Stopped --> Notify
    InFlight --> [*]: retry next tick, alarm if stuck
    InSync --> [*]
    Notify --> [*]: waits for resolve / unblock / user
